/Title (Based on the reviewed literature and related works, existing systems provide useful features such as NLP intent classification, verified knowledge bases, and automated conversational interfaces. However, most systems do not combine multilingual support \(English, Tagalog, Cebuano\), controlled retraining, an admin analytics dashboard, and an open-source locally deployable architecture in one system. This gap supports the development of VISTA as a comprehensive, multilingual, and locally manageable automated inquiry system tailored for Panabo City Hall and similar local government units. )
